{"task_id": "HumanEval/55", "solution": "_fib_cache = {}\n\ndef fib(n: int):\n    \"\"\"Return n-th Fibonacci number.\n    >>> fib(10)\n    55\n    >>> fib(1)\n    1\n    >>> fib(8)\n    21\n    \"\"\"\n    # Return cached value if available.\n    if n in _fib_cache:\n        return _fib_cache[n]\n\n    # Compute the Fibonacci number iteratively.\n    if n == 0:\n        result = 0\n    else:\n        a, b = 0, 1\n        for _ in range(1, n):\n            a, b = b, a + b\n        result = b\n\n    # Store and return the computed result.\n    _fib_cache[n] = result\n    return result"}
