{"task_id": "HumanEval/82", "solution": "def prime_length(string):\n    \"\"\"Write a function that takes a string and returns True if the string\n    length is a prime number or False otherwise\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(string)\n\n    if n < 2:\n        return False\n    if n == 2:\n        return True\n    if n % 2 == 0:\n        return False\n\n    i = 3\n    import math\n    # Optimized trial division: check divisibility only up to sqrt(n)\n    limit = int(math.isqrt(n))\n    while i <= limit:\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return False\n        i += 2\n    return True"}
